{"4530640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aevalore", "steam_appid": 4530640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4751690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AEVALORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A genre of its own — Monster Hunter loot-crafting, Brotato instant battles, and Guild Wars 1 build depth, fused into fast roguelike runs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't read dialogue. You build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every run is a climb: level your hero, assemble your kit, and grow from fragile to unstoppable in ten relentless minutes. Then you bank what you earned, come back stronger, and push into harder difficulties. The depth isn't handed to you. You build toward it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREAK THE META</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ heroes, each with a unique 12-skill kit — pick 4 per run. Stack stat cards mid-fight. Forge gear from monster drops. Spend gold between runs on permanent upgrades. No two builds play the same, and the wildest ones aren't unlocked at level 1 — they're earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 MINUTES TO GLORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. You have ten minutes to level your hero, survive a relentlessly scaling horde, and take down the boss. Loot gold, bank permanent upgrades, and prepare for the next drop. Win or die, you walk away stronger — then you do it again, deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR BUILD, IN REAL TIME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-match cards let you reshape your hero mid-fight. More health? Higher crit? Longer dodge? Your build evolves live based on the cards you play and the stats you prioritize in the pause menu. Level a hero to 100 and earn the <strong>GOLD CHARACTER ICON TRIM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERYTHING IS EARNED </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-Leveling System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent Tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins &amp; Skill Transmogrification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forge — monsters drop materials you craft into equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot Machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 Achievements &amp; displayable Titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ songs across 9 radio stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS. EVER.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...AND MORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 HEROES — EACH A DIFFERENT GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violet, the Illusionist · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jade, the Archer · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schope, the Engineer ·</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rurik, the Iron Guard · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baron, the Ghostly Pirate · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zaroth, the Warlock · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mizu, the Water Bender ·</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kawghe, the Umbral · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brock, the KO Master · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urph, the Angler · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navi, the Warchief · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ajna, the Psychic · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuart, the Origamist · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dhume, the Necromancer · </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soren, the Lightbearer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 MAPS · 10+ DIFFICULTIES · UNDER 2GB</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Built on Godot 4.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AEVALORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A genre of its own — Monster Hunter loot-crafting, Brotato instant battles, and Guild Wars 1 build depth, fused into fast roguelike runs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't rea